        <Literal xml:lang="en">Prejudice or discrimination against individuals with a darker skin tone, typically among people of the same ethnic or racial group.1 While related to physical appearance, it&apos;s a specific form of prejudice based on skin shade, often linked to internalized racism.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
        <AnnotationProperty abbreviatedIRI="rdfs:label"/>
